### TeamForge Phase 15 API Tests (REST Client Format)
### Collaboration UX: Active Project Cap, Skill-Match Hint, Rejection Suggestions, Direct Invites,
### Unread Chat Badge, Ranked User Search, Closed/Completed Requirements Export & Clone as Draft

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@ownerToken = Bearer YOUR_OWNER_TOKEN_HERE
@collabToken = Bearer YOUR_COLLABORATOR_TOKEN_HERE
@outsiderToken = Bearer YOUR_OUTSIDER_TOKEN_HERE
@adminToken = Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

### --------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. SKILL-MATCH HINT (NEVER BLOCKS APPLYING)
### --------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1a. Compute Skill-Match Percentage & Missing Skills for Current User
# Expected Status: 200 OK -> { percent, shared, missing } (percent: null if project has no skills)
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/PROJECT_ID/match
Authorization: {{collabToken}}

### --------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. ACTIVE PROJECT CAP (MAX 3 NON-FINISHED COLLABORATOR MEMBERSHIPS)
### --------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2a. Apply Beyond Active Project Cap (Owning Does Not Count)
# Expected Status: 409 Conflict (ACTIVE_PROJECT_CAP with currentCount, maxAllowed, projects[])
POST {{baseUrl}}/join-requests
Authorization: {{collabToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": "PROJECT_ID_4",
  "userId": "USER_ID",
  "userName": "User Name",
  "message": "Excited to contribute!"
}

### --------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. REJECTION SUGGESTIONS (UP TO 3 SIMILAR OPEN PROJECTS)
### --------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3a. Owner Rejects Request -> Returns suggestedProjects on Request & Notification
# Expected Status: 200 OK
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/join-requests/REQUEST_ID
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Rejected",
  "reason": "Looking for more backend experience on this sprint."
}

###

### 3b. Collaborator Reads My Requests (Includes suggestedProjects)
# Expected Status: 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/join-requests/mine
Authorization: {{collabToken}}

### --------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. DIRECT PROJECT INVITATIONS
### --------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4a. Owner Sends Direct Invite by Username
# Expected Status: 201 Created (404 USER_NOT_FOUND, 409 ALREADY_MEMBER / INVITE_LIMIT / REINVITE_COOLDOWN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/PROJECT_ID/invites
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "arjunsharma"
}

###

### 4b. Non-Owner Attempts to Send Invite
# Expected Status: 403 Forbidden
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/PROJECT_ID/invites
Authorization: {{collabToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "kiranbose"
}

###

### 4c. Owner Lists Project Invites
# Expected Status: 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/PROJECT_ID/invites
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}

###

### 4d. Invited User Lists Their Invites
# Expected Status: 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/invites
Authorization: {{collabToken}}

###

### 4e. Invited User Accepts Invite (Runs in Project Queue, Checks Capacity & Cap)
# Expected Status: 200 OK (or 409 PROJECT_FULL / ACTIVE_PROJECT_CAP / INVITE_EXPIRED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/invites/INVITE_ID/accept
Authorization: {{collabToken}}

###

### 4f. Invited User Declines Invite (Optional block: true sets 14-day cooldown)
# Expected Status: 200 OK
POST {{baseUrl}}/invites/INVITE_ID/decline
Authorization: {{collabToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "block": false
}

###

### 4g. Owner Cancels Pending Invite
# Expected Status: 200 OK
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/projects/PROJECT_ID/invites/INVITE_ID
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}

### --------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. UNREAD CHAT BADGE & READ RECEIPTS
### --------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 5a. Fetch Unread Chat Summary Across Active Projects
# Expected Status: 200 OK -> { total, byProject: [...] }
GET {{baseUrl}}/communication/unread
Authorization: {{collabToken}}

###

### 5b. Mark Project Chat Read (Zeroes Unread for Caller)
# Expected Status: 200 OK -> { projectId, userId, lastReadAt }
POST {{baseUrl}}/communication/projects/PROJECT_ID/read
Authorization: {{collabToken}}

###

### 5c. Non-Member Attempts to Mark Project Chat Read (Phase 6 Guard)
# Expected Status: 403 Forbidden (CHAT_MEMBERSHIP_REQUIRED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/communication/projects/PROJECT_ID/read
Authorization: {{outsiderToken}}

### --------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. USER SEARCH RANKING (EXACT -> PREFIX -> SUBSTRING)
### --------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 6a. Search Users for Picker
# Expected Status: 200 OK (exact username first, then username prefix, name prefix, other substring)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/search?q=arjun
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}

### --------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. CLOSED / COMPLETED EXPORT MARKDOWN & CLONE AS DRAFT
### --------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 7a. Export Finished Project Requirements & Tasks as Markdown (Owner or Admin)
# Expected Status: 200 OK (text/markdown) | 409 PROJECT_NOT_FINISHED on active project
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/FINISHED_PROJECT_ID/export.md
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}

###

### 7b. Clone Finished Project as New Draft (Owner Only)
# Expected Status: 201 Created -> { id, projectId, status: "Draft", ... }
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/FINISHED_PROJECT_ID/clone
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}

###

### 7c. Non-Owner Attempts Export or Clone
# Expected Status: 403 Forbidden
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/FINISHED_PROJECT_ID/clone
Authorization: {{collabToken}}
